WEBVTT

01:37.820 --> 01:40.070
Neo-Saitama, pier 3.

01:40.070 --> 01:45.290
Negotiations between SŌKAIYA and a gang over the illegal drug MEN TAI's price

01:45.290 --> 01:48.000
were interrupted by the appearance of a NINJA!

01:48.960 --> 01:51.210
Is this your sign of submission?

01:51.210 --> 01:53.130
Yes! I'm sorry!

01:54.380 --> 01:56.300
Everyone makes mistakes.

01:56.300 --> 01:58.590
And ignorance begets arrogance.

01:58.590 --> 02:02.560
But SŌKAIYA's NINJA are no mere bluff.
You know that now, right?

02:02.560 --> 02:04.390
Yes! I'm sorry!

02:04.390 --> 02:06.520
So I'm sure we can keep working together.

02:06.520 --> 02:09.020
Yes! I'm sorry!

02:09.690 --> 02:14.030
The NINJA of SŌKAIYA, Arson,
got inside his KAMON taxi.

02:09.690 --> 02:14.030
NOTE: KAMON is the family crest of NINJA.

02:15.280 --> 02:17.200
Take me to Tokorozawa Pillar.

02:17.200 --> 02:18.740
With pleasure, sir.

02:20.660 --> 02:23.790
MACHINE OF VENGEANCE

02:37.590 --> 02:40.720
You're not the guy who was here last week.

02:40.720 --> 02:43.600
Kameji-SAN has retired.

02:43.600 --> 02:44.680
Has he?

02:47.890 --> 02:51.230
Hey! This isn't the right route, you fool!

02:51.230 --> 02:54.070
I'm sorry, but this is the correct route.

02:54.070 --> 02:54.730
What?

02:55.530 --> 02:57.490
Because you're going to Hell.

03:02.870 --> 03:05.030
What? What are you doing?

03:05.280 --> 03:07.330
The KAMON taxi is out of control!

03:07.330 --> 03:09.660
Just what is the driver planning to do?

03:09.960 --> 03:10.960
You will die here!

03:11.290 --> 03:12.210
YEEART!

03:13.040 --> 03:14.540
GWAAAGGHGH!

03:16.670 --> 03:19.130
You bastard! Who are you with, assassin?

03:19.130 --> 03:21.430
Don't screw with us, asshole!

03:24.100 --> 03:25.600
NINJA?

03:26.600 --> 03:29.270
DŌMO, I am NINJA Slayer.

03:29.270 --> 03:32.230
You say you're NINJA Slayer?

03:32.230 --> 03:34.650
DŌMO, NINJA Slayer-SAN.

03:34.650 --> 03:36.270
I am Arson.

03:36.270 --> 03:38.610
I never thought you truly existed.

03:38.610 --> 03:40.740
I thought you were just an excuse for losers!

03:40.740 --> 03:42.030
Do not worry.

03:42.030 --> 03:44.120
You won't need to think of an excuse.

03:44.120 --> 03:46.370
Because I'm sending you to Hell!

03:46.370 --> 03:48.040
Shut up!

03:48.620 --> 03:49.950
YEEART!

03:49.950 --> 03:52.420
Arson's specialty is a type of KATON JITSU.

03:49.950 --> 03:52.420
NOTE: KATON JITSU is NINJA fire magic.

03:52.420 --> 03:57.630
This cruel assassination technique burns an
enemy to death with supernatural combustion!

03:57.920 --> 03:58.630
YEEART!

03:58.630 --> 03:59.170
HAH!

03:59.170 --> 03:59.710
What?

03:59.710 --> 04:00.340
YEEART!

04:00.340 --> 04:01.550
GWAAARGH!

04:02.340 --> 04:04.340
Die, bastard!

04:06.930 --> 04:07.810
YEEART!

04:07.810 --> 04:09.060
GWAAARGH!

04:11.390 --> 04:12.730
Impossible...

04:12.730 --> 04:14.150
Who are you?

04:14.650 --> 04:17.980
I will not let a single NINJA survive!

04:17.980 --> 04:20.490
Do you really think you can get away with this?

04:20.490 --> 04:21.990
NINJA must be slain!

04:21.990 --> 04:23.990
YEEART!

04:28.080 --> 04:31.040
A fatal error! KATON JITSU is useless if it misses!

04:31.410 --> 04:32.500
YEEART!

04:32.500 --> 04:34.170
ᗅᗺᗷᗅ!

04:35.250 --> 04:37.460
Reinforcements are coming.

04:37.460 --> 04:38.630
It's true!

04:38.630 --> 04:40.210
That's just what I want!

04:40.210 --> 04:42.630
A more powerful NINJA...

04:42.630 --> 04:44.680
Dark NINJA-SAN!

04:44.680 --> 04:48.100
He won't let you live!

04:48.100 --> 04:51.060
I won't let any of.you live!

04:51.060 --> 04:52.140
SAYŌNARA!

04:58.520 --> 05:00.780
Cheap! Cheap!

05:00.780 --> 05:03.070
We're practically giving it away!

05:03.070 --> 05:09.240
This blimp is for advertising purposes,
and isn't fishy at all.

05:09.240 --> 05:13.620
A demonstration will show how reliable our products are,

05:14.210 --> 05:18.170
and increase the effectiveness of our advertising.

05:18.170 --> 05:18.840
LOCKED ON

05:28.090 --> 05:32.180
The explosions will increase the effectiveness of our advertising.

05:32.640 --> 05:37.850
This is an anti-NINJA blimp, made by OMURA, INC., and sent by SŌKAIYA.

05:37.850 --> 05:39.110
ONI

05:50.370 --> 05:54.620
This is SŌKAIYA's headquarters, the Tokorozawa Pillar.

05:54.620 --> 05:56.370
This man's name is Laomoto!

05:57.620 --> 06:00.710
We have a lock on the target NINJA.

06:02.040 --> 06:03.340
Well done.

06:03.340 --> 06:06.630
The power of our ONI
combat blimp, Bubujima, will—

06:03.340 --> 06:06.630
NOTE: ONI are NINJA demons of JAPAN.

06:06.630 --> 06:08.800
Insolent!

06:08.800 --> 06:10.090
AIYEEE!

06:11.140 --> 06:13.220
This is entertainment.

06:13.220 --> 06:17.020
Who told you to talk about business?

06:17.020 --> 06:18.980
You're right, of course!

06:19.270 --> 06:23.400
Show me what that toy can do!

06:25.610 --> 06:30.820
He ate two thick, fatty TORO MAGURO SUSHI at once!

06:36.290 --> 06:38.160
For a NINJA,

06:38.160 --> 06:42.380
striking down subsonic homing missiles is like swatting mosquitoes!

06:43.380 --> 06:44.800
YEEART!

06:49.550 --> 06:50.380
AIYEEE?

07:04.110 --> 07:09.400
NINJA Slayer can launch his SURIKEN with more force than a slingshot!

07:04.110 --> 07:09.400
NOTE: SURIKEN are a great NINJA'S SHURIKEN.

07:10.110 --> 07:12.530
AIYEEE! Just what is going on?

07:12.530 --> 07:15.330
You're letting him hit you back, huh?

07:15.330 --> 07:20.870
Even with all that weaponry,
you can't defeat a single rogue NINJA?

07:20.870 --> 07:23.830
No! You see, this is actually a prototype...

07:23.830 --> 07:25.250
Everything's fine!

07:25.250 --> 07:31.720
I'm starting to get a little upset, Omura-SAN.

07:31.720 --> 07:36.060
Um... Laomoto-SAN, why don't we show you what our company's NINJAS can do?

07:36.060 --> 07:37.310
It doesn't matter what!

07:37.310 --> 07:39.060
JUST KILL HIM!

07:39.060 --> 07:41.060
AIYEEEEEEEEE!

07:41.690 --> 07:42.350
Go!

07:42.650 --> 07:44.610
Yes! With pleasure!

07:50.240 --> 07:51.900
NAMU SAN! A NINJA!

07:50.240 --> 07:51.900
NOTE: NAMU SAN is BUDDHIST.

07:51.900 --> 07:55.030
That NINJA is wearing a jetpack!

07:55.030 --> 07:57.740
DŌMO. I am Cloud Buster.

07:57.740 --> 08:00.450
DŌMO. I am NINJA Slayer.

08:00.450 --> 08:02.250
I can face whatever you send after me!

08:02.250 --> 08:03.960
Sheer arrogance!

08:03.960 --> 08:04.500
YEEART!

08:08.800 --> 08:09.920
GWAARGGH!

08:09.920 --> 08:11.880
This is the power of SCIENCE!

08:13.130 --> 08:14.550
YEEART!

08:26.150 --> 08:28.110
INDUSTRY!

08:28.360 --> 08:28.940
YEEART!

08:28.940 --> 08:30.150
GWAARGH!

08:31.150 --> 08:33.650
Stiff Shoulders

08:38.950 --> 08:40.870
INDUSTRY!

08:41.080 --> 08:42.330
GWAARGH!

08:59.060 --> 09:02.180
I enjoyed that quite a bit, Omura-SAN.

09:03.140 --> 09:04.810
Thank you very much, sir!

09:04.810 --> 09:06.850
I apologize for the slip-up back there.

09:07.480 --> 09:09.320
Recover the body.

09:09.320 --> 09:14.450
Find out everything you can about this insect who would oppose my syndicate.

09:14.900 --> 09:16.320
With pleasure!

09:16.950 --> 09:19.120
Poor NINJA Slayer!

09:19.120 --> 09:22.330
Is he truly dead?

09:27.750 --> 09:32.960
Pathetic. This is simply pathetic, Fujikido.

09:32.960 --> 09:33.840
Shut up!

09:36.300 --> 09:38.970
With the power of my TRUE KARATE,

09:38.970 --> 09:43.470
that little mosquito would be no match for you!

09:43.470 --> 09:45.940
Silence, monster!

09:45.940 --> 09:47.350
I will do it myself!

09:47.350 --> 09:50.150
Do what? Tell me!

09:50.150 --> 09:51.770
Slay NINJA!

09:52.020 --> 09:55.030
Then the answer is plain, is it not?

09:55.780 --> 09:58.700
NINJA must be slain!

10:02.910 --> 10:08.330
I shall show you how it's done... personally.

10:12.840 --> 10:13.670
What?

10:14.000 --> 10:15.010
Impossible!

10:15.010 --> 10:17.050
He was dead for sure!

10:17.930 --> 10:18.630
YEEART!

10:18.630 --> 10:20.390
GWAAAGGH!

10:25.980 --> 10:27.980
INDUSTRY!

10:30.480 --> 10:31.610
Impossible!

10:31.610 --> 10:34.610
You must have taken damage from the electricity!

10:34.610 --> 10:35.730
Fool!

10:36.070 --> 10:40.610
Dazzling electric lights flash in the darkness of the midnight hour!

10:41.240 --> 10:41.780
YEEART!

10:41.780 --> 10:43.780
DEGRAAAGH!

10:44.580 --> 10:45.910
YEEART!

10:46.250 --> 10:47.540
GWAARGH!

10:47.870 --> 10:49.420
GUUUAGH!

10:51.250 --> 10:53.750
GUUUWAAGGGGHRH!

10:53.750 --> 10:56.260
Eh? AIYEE!

10:58.670 --> 10:59.840
SAYŌNARA!

11:03.800 --> 11:05.470
WASSHOI!

11:03.800 --> 11:05.470
NOTE: WASSHOI is JAPANESE.

11:06.930 --> 11:10.190
You're a fool to think this flying metal makes you powerful.

11:10.190 --> 11:13.730
It is inferior to even the weakest KARATE!

11:13.730 --> 11:16.360
AIYEEEHHH!

11:16.360 --> 11:18.320
AIYEEGGHhhh!

11:28.200 --> 11:32.080
NINJA Slayer-SAN!

11:36.920 --> 11:38.090
Hmm...

11:38.380 --> 11:41.430
I thought I smelled money,
but I guess I was wrong.

11:41.430 --> 11:43.050
Is there anything in his pockets?

11:43.050 --> 11:44.050
AIYEEE!

11:44.850 --> 11:47.060
Where am I?

11:48.270 --> 11:50.520
Old Tokyo Bay!

11:50.520 --> 11:53.440
Take me to the underworld doctor whose name I will tell you.

11:53.440 --> 11:54.520
Yes, sir!

11:55.980 --> 11:57.940
We can talk about the details later!

11:57.940 --> 11:59.990
You guys just get out of here!

12:04.240 --> 12:07.160
<i>Damn it all! I'm done with this!</i>

12:05.740 --> 12:07.990
I'm terrified! This is INGAOHŌ!

12:07.160 --> 12:09.120
<i>I'm done with this business!</i>

12:08.290 --> 12:10.410
I'll stop dealing MEN TAI.

12:09.120 --> 12:11.460
<i>I'll atone to the people who got addicted!</i>

12:10.410 --> 12:13.080
I'll take this man to his doctor and run to Kyoto!

12:12.580 --> 12:15.380
<i>I'll be a BUDDHIST!</i>

12:13.080 --> 12:15.040
I'll learn ZEN and be a priest!

12:15.380 --> 12:17.000
<i>So please, stop!</i>

12:17.000 --> 12:18.550
<i>I'm done! This is INGAOHŌ!</i>

12:19.210 --> 12:24.260
Smith experiences NINJA reality shock feedback as he rides on his jetski,

12:24.260 --> 12:27.550
carrying the grim reaper of NINJA on his back!

12:27.550 --> 12:31.890
INGAOHŌ!

12:27.550 --> 12:31.890
NOTE: INGAOHŌ is NINJA karma.
